Third-party notices
===================

ARGUS can load two optional cyber geo data sets. The binaries are not part of
this repository. `scripts/fetch_geo.py` downloads the pinned v2fly release
assets into `data/geo/` after the official `.sha256sum` file and the downloaded
bytes both match `geo.lock.json`. Other publishers are not used.

